# Medieval pieces: Settings -> Piece Theme -> Medieval (the 5th option, 200x44 at x=50, centre y=272+64*4 = 528), then the same Standard mid-game as board-styles.ui
# (two turns played, the white knight picked up) in the Atlas, Blueprint (greyscale pieces) and Deep space board views, cycled as there.
# Layout (1400x800): main menu Settings (150,490; (150,520) once a game left an autosave); Piece Theme tab (520,172); Display tab (880,172);
# Board view button (700,468); in the game Back (125,25) leads to the mode list, whose Back is (700,712). Squares are clicked by name.
wait 20
click 150 490        # Settings
wait 30
click 520 172        # Piece Theme tab
wait 20
click 150 528        # Medieval
wait 20
capture medieval-settings
click 880 172        # Display tab
wait 20
mode standard
wait 40
clicksq 0 0 e2
wait 20
clicksq 0 0 e4
wait 20
click 841 90         # Submit
wait 60
clicksq 0 1 e7
wait 20
clicksq 0 1 e5
wait 20
click 841 90
wait 60
clicksq 0 2 g1       # pick up the knight: its targets show on the present board
wait 60
capture medieval-atlas
click 125 25         # Back to the mode list ...
wait 30
click 700 712        # ... and to the main menu
wait 30
click 150 520        # Settings
wait 30
click 880 172        # Display tab
wait 20
click 700 468        # Board view: Blueprint
wait 10
mode standard
wait 40
clicksq 0 0 e2
wait 20
clicksq 0 0 e4
wait 20
click 841 90
wait 60
clicksq 0 1 e7
wait 20
clicksq 0 1 e5
wait 20
click 841 90
wait 60
clicksq 0 2 g1
wait 60
capture medieval-blueprint
click 125 25
wait 30
click 700 712
wait 30
click 150 520
wait 30
click 880 172
wait 20
click 700 468        # Board view: Deep space (Blueprint -> Deep space)
wait 10
mode standard
wait 40
clicksq 0 0 e2
wait 20
clicksq 0 0 e4
wait 20
click 841 90
wait 60
clicksq 0 1 e7
wait 20
clicksq 0 1 e5
wait 20
click 841 90
wait 60
clicksq 0 2 g1
wait 60
capture medieval-deep-space
